    "## 3. Tuning, inside the training years only\n",
    "\n",
    "For each model I try a few settings and keep the one with the lowest log loss, a score that rewards good probabilities and not only good ranking. To mimic predicting a year the model has not seen, I use leave-one-year-out: train on two of the years 2002-2004, check on the third, and repeat."
   ]
